source=[
('04fa0ba1-eb6e-53c8-93d4-dfa28bb4b162','Redox donor/acceptor and roles are actual BY C9-NTG.3 content, not an E-phase-only inference. Relevant whole Zn/Cu and Fe/Cu P cases use given ion charges, not a new formal oxidation-number-table duty.'),
('1c1420c2-a8e2-520f-8015-6df637a973bd','BY C10 non-NTG.4 explicitly teaches Brønsted particle roles, protolysis equations and water ampholyte; existing whole HF/NH3 and supplied phosphate transfer cases fit. This general SekI target is an all-authored source-union component, not a claim all states teach it in the same year.'),
('448815cc-4127-54b7-96bf-e54b3d2a38c5','BB/BE SekI primary pp33/36/37 actually contain covalent, ionic and metallic/electron-gas models; p37 explicitly compares them. Whole P simple Cu/NaCl/Cl2 models stay at this bounded level. No higher quantum or universal bonding-energy routine is imported.'),
('4961130b-1ee8-58f2-a319-dff0a864db6a','BY C10 non-NTG.5 actually requires inorganic AND organic oxidation numbers and aqueous half-equation/overall redox balances. Whole Mn/Fe and ethanol/CuO cases are legitimate late-SekI target duties in the generic source union. Preserve this topic as an independent target, even though it is too broad a universal prior for the supplied 1f30 comparison.'),
('4aa3a130-b517-5ac5-87b2-147fe432cadd','BY C9-NTG.1 includes error-linked interpretation; C10.1 explicitly evaluates validity of collected/researched data. Whole unknown X/Y cross-reactivity and temperature/matrix cases use supplied method facts; they do not require inventing/selecting an already validated unknown apparatus. Source bindings stay partial; no upper-only full source union is asserted.'),
('95dc0ee5-a0af-5682-af32-d66e36fbeb50','BY C8.1 and C9-NTG.1 explicitly distinguish everyday/technical language, substance/particle levels and symbol/formula use for atoms, molecules, ions, reactions and interactions. Whole existing competence is a real SekI communication target, not an arbitrary catalogue recall duty.'),
('9b56d01e-c2d7-51d8-b78e-237592c1ed20','BY C9-NTG.4 and non-NTG C10.2 explicitly derive molecule shapes and estimate angles with EPA. Existing supplied Lewis-formula CH4/H2O and NH3/BH3 cases fit the model; no hybridisation mastery is added. BB p33 lists geometry as differentiation, which remains distinct from BY explicit competence.'),
('eb7537dd-d11b-50e9-a6d7-51a78e96fc4e','BY C9-NTG.5 and non-NTG C10.3 explicitly include London/dispersion, permanent dipoles, hydrogen bonds and ion-dipole contacts. Whole existing examples explain self/mixed interactions and reject universal boiling-rank slogans; genuine SekI acquisition supports both water properties and salt hydration energy.'),
('9fc800d1-92d1-5ef6-81c1-33960ae034dd','BY C8.1 guided documentation, C9 familiar independent/unknown assisted and C10 independent documentation give a real SekI progression. Original R1/R2 and D2 raw-data/calculation logs keep guidance, missing-metadata and actual-performance limits. Digital data/table use is not by itself an upper-stage restriction.'),
('7d9fcc7f-1c20-5d5b-9cf6-05f6b624dab6','BY C8/C9 hypothesis-linked interpretation and C10 trends/relationships genuinely support this existing lower data-interpretation atom. Original repeat/temperature and conductivity/sucrose materials require chemical explanation plus bounded hypothesis inference; not a whole upper quantitative hypothesis-testing routine.')]
